{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The light is among you a little while lon[C#]ger
Walk while you have the [D#m]light
So that darkness does not overtake you
The [C#]one who walks in the darkness
Does not [B]know where he is go[D#m]ing
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
While you have the light
Believe in [C#]the light
So [B]that you may be[C#]come
Sons of [D#m]light
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
He said these things and then he went a[C#]way
And he hid from [D#m]them
Though he had done so many signs before them
They [C#]did not believe in [B]him
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
While you have the [D#m]light
Believe in [C#]the light
So [B]that you may be[C#]come
Sons of [D#m]light
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[B]Lord who has be[C#]lieved our message
And to [D#m]whom has the arm of the [F#]Lord been revealed
[B]For this reason they could [C#]not believe
Because I[A#m]saiah said a[D#m]gain
{end_of_bridge}

